{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-a2-15w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn A2 15W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Uwell Caliburn A2 15W Pod System, featuring an integrated 520mAh battery, 15W maximum output, and uses the new 0.9ohm Caliburn A2 Pods. Constructed from durable aluminum alloy, the chassis of the Caliburn A2 Pod System encases an integrated 520mAh rechargeable battery. Delivering up to 15W output, the constant voltage output is stable and produces delicious flavor from your favorite eJuice or nicotine salts. Outfitted with a LED battery life indicator light, the Caliburn A2 Pod System can be fired via button or draw-activated mechanisms, producing exquisite vapor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"uwell caliburn a2 pod system\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0480\/2061\/9416\/files\/caliburn_a2_infographic.jpg?v=1645221052\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUwell Caliburn A2 15W Pod System Features:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 110mm by 21.3mm by 11.7mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 520mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaximum Wattage Output: 15W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminum-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive Firing Button - Draw or Button Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Battery Life Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.9ohm UN2 Meshed Coil Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePro-FOCS Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eE-Liquid Viewing Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Voltage Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e8S Timeout Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Circuit Prompt\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C USB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in Blue, Green, Black, Grey, Iris Purple, Orange\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\nIncludes:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn A2 Pod System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 0.9ohm Caliburn A2 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41673630842935,"sku":"U Cali A2 Pod System","price":3560.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_caliburn_a2_-_pod_system_-_sample_-_all_colors.png?v=1747872213","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-a2-15w-pod-system","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




